{"sha":"10953f021b3bab8a92d10def897bb489cacad625","node_id":"C_kwDOAblqCtoAKDEwOTUzZjAyMWIzYmFiOGE5MmQxMGRlZjg5N2JiNDg5Y2FjYWQ2MjU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Tobias Frauenschläger","email":"tobias@wolfssl.com","date":"2026-03-30T09:47:13Z"},"committer":{"name":"Tobias Frauenschläger","email":"tobias@wolfssl.com","date":"2026-04-02T10:35:15Z"},"message":"CMAC: fix wraparound in streaming update.\n\nThe guard `if (cmac->totalSz != 0)` was used to skip XOR-chaining on\nthe first block (where digest is all-zeros and the XOR is a no-op).\nHowever, totalSz is word32 and wraps to zero after 2^28 block flushes\n(4 GiB), causing the guard to erroneously fire again and discard the\nlive CBC-MAC chain state.  Any two messages sharing a common suffix\nbeyond the 4 GiB mark then produce identical CMAC tags, enabling a\nzero-work prefix-substitution forgery.  The fix removes the guard,\nmaking the XOR unconditional; the no-op property on the first block is\npreserved because digest is zero-initialized by wc_InitCmac_ex.\n\nIdentified by: Nicholas Carlini (Anthropic) & Thai Duong (Calif.io)","tree":{"sha":"3eda1ec2cd18a8cf91fa63b7ce2d4ca847a31698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wolfSSL/wolfssl/git/trees/3eda1ec2cd18a8cf91fa63b7ce2d4ca847a31698"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wolfSSL/wolfssl/git/commits/10953f021b3bab8a92d10def897bb489cacad625","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wolfSSL/wolfssl/commits/10953f021b3bab8a92d10def897bb489cacad625","html_url":"https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/commit/10953f021b3bab8a92d10def897bb489cacad625","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wolfSSL/wolfssl/commits/10953f021b3bab8a92d10def897bb489cacad625/comments","author":{"login":"Frauschi","id":5159151,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNTkxNTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5159151?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi","html_url":"https://github.com/Frauschi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"Frauschi","id":5159151,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNTkxNTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5159151?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi","html_url":"https://github.com/Frauschi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"24f9981877ceb44b656b10309f22e749455bb64e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wolfSSL/wolfssl/commits/24f9981877ceb44b656b10309f22e749455bb64e","html_url":"https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/commit/24f9981877ceb44b656b10309f22e749455bb64e"}],"stats":{"total":8,"additions":2,"deletions":6},"files":[{"sha":"a3b75dbb34bdced34afa974c1dccb05437a7cd7a","filename":"wolfcrypt/src/aes.c","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":3,"changes":4,"blob_url":"https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/blob/10953f021b3bab8a92d10def897bb489cacad625/wolfcrypt%2Fsrc%2Faes.c","raw_url":"https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/raw/10953f021b3bab8a92d10def897bb489cacad625/wolfcrypt%2Fsrc%2Faes.c","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wolfSSL/wolfssl/contents/wolfcrypt%2Fsrc%2Faes.c?ref=10953f021b3bab8a92d10def897bb489cacad625","patch":"@@ -16377,9 +16377,7 @@ int wc_local_CmacUpdateAes(struct Cmac *cmac, const byte* in, word32 inSz) {\n         in += add;\n \n         if (cmac->bufferSz == WC_AES_BLOCK_SIZE && inSz != 0) {\n-            if (cmac->totalSz != 0) {\n-                xorbuf(cmac->buffer, cmac->digest, WC_AES_BLOCK_SIZE);\n-            }\n+            xorbuf(cmac->buffer, cmac->digest, WC_AES_BLOCK_SIZE);\n             ret = AesEncrypt_preFetchOpt(aes, cmac->buffer,\n                                             cmac->digest, &did_prefetches);\n             if (ret == 0) {"},{"sha":"ba579516d1bafbd4fb196b6624157c37cb0bd403","filename":"wolfcrypt/src/cmac.c","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":3,"changes":4,"blob_url":"https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/blob/10953f021b3bab8a92d10def897bb489cacad625/wolfcrypt%2Fsrc%2Fcmac.c","raw_url":"https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/raw/10953f021b3bab8a92d10def897bb489cacad625/wolfcrypt%2Fsrc%2Fcmac.c","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wolfSSL/wolfssl/contents/wolfcrypt%2Fsrc%2Fcmac.c?ref=10953f021b3bab8a92d10def897bb489cacad625","patch":"@@ -238,9 +238,7 @@ int wc_CmacUpdate(Cmac* cmac, const byte* in, word32 inSz)\n             inSz -= add;\n \n             if (cmac->bufferSz == WC_AES_BLOCK_SIZE && inSz != 0) {\n-                if (cmac->totalSz != 0) {\n-                    xorbuf(cmac->buffer, cmac->digest, WC_AES_BLOCK_SIZE);\n-                }\n+                xorbuf(cmac->buffer, cmac->digest, WC_AES_BLOCK_SIZE);\n                 wc_AesEncryptDirect(&cmac->aes, cmac->digest,\n                         cmac->buffer);\n                 cmac->totalSz += WC_AES_BLOCK_SIZE;"}]}